# demo_interactive_grid Specification

## Overview

`demo_interactive_grid` demonstrates an interactive grid UI using asimov.io for terminal-based interaction.

## Usage

```bash
python demo_interactive_grid.py [options]
```

## Arguments

| Argument | Type | Default | Description |
|----------|------|---------|-------------|
| `--device` | int | 0 | Camera device index |

## Features

- Interactive grid-based UI in terminal
- Keyboard navigation support
- Real-time video capture integration

## Exit

- Press ESC to quit
